Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, last night I saw someone sneaking around down by the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on my way home from a classy client.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know him well, so I agreed to a quick fuck in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I was supposed to be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we saw that guy sneaking around with a gas can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He ran when he saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And this morning we heard about the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I really think it was him.
